\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview. The OCC family is chosen on $\mathcal  {D}_L$ only. A sample rejected by every calibrated OCC is a candidate novelty. The rejected set is clustered with a minimum cluster size derived from the expected number of samples of known classes rejected by mistake. In the incremental setting each discovered class becomes a new OCC.}}{6}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
